      "side": 1,
      "message": "Although I understand your concern that you would like to restrict the usages of this property, I don\u0027t fully agree with the practicality of having such property. For example, defining a non-empty `High_priority_deps` without specifying the boolean property would lead to the property being a no-op, which may be confusing to the users. We could raise an error when `High_priority_deps` is non-empty and the boolean property is not specified to true, but the purpose of the property is uncertain at that point.",
